# Redirects served by Cloudflare Workers static assets.
#
# Legacy Joomla URLs (index.php?option=com_*, /component/*) are deliberately
# NOT redirected — decided 2026-09-02, they 404 after cutover. See STATUS.md
# "Decisions / workarounds worth knowing".
#
# The one exception: the PDFs moved from Joomla's /images/downloads/ to
# /downloads/ on 2026-09-02. These files get linked directly from emails and
# WhatsApp groups and indexed by search engines, so the old paths must keep
# working — this is why moving them was safe.
/images/downloads/* /downloads/:splat 301
